# Project-local ignore. Secrets and OS noise are already covered by the
# global ~/.config/git/ignore — this file carries only this project's
# byproducts and, above all, anything that could carry local truth out of
# this machine and into a public repository.

# ── Local truth. None of this is ever committed. ────────────────────
# The German design log names a real machine, real paths and a real
# person. It stays beside the code and out of the repository; the public
# half of it is DESIGN.md.
*.local.md
*.local.toml
*.local.json
# A privacy word list is personal by definition (see bin/check).
.privacy-words

# ── QML / tooling byproducts ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.qmlc
*.jsc
.qmlls.ini
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Scratch, screenshots (a screenshot shows a real desktop) ──────────
tmp/
*.png
*.jpg
.mise.local.toml

# ── Editors and vaults ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/
.idea/
.vscode/
